@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@orgId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@otherOrgId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### =========================================================================
### PHASE 1: USERS MANUAL TESTING SUITE
### =========================================================================

### 1. Create User (Success 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-user-key-001

{
  "email": "jane.doe@resolve.com",
  "username": "jane.doe",
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. Missing Idempotency-Key Header (Error 400 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "missing.key@resolve.com",
  "username": "missing.key",
  "fullName": "Missing Key User"
}

### 3. Idempotency Replay (Success 201 - Returns exact original response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-user-key-001

{
  "email": "jane.doe@resolve.com",
  "username": "jane.doe",
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 4. Idempotency Key Reused with Different Body (Error 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-user-key-001

{
  "email": "different.body@resolve.com",
  "username": "different.body",
  "fullName": "Different Body User"
}

### 5. Field Validation Failure (Error 400 USER_VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-user-key-002

{
  "email": "invalid-email-address",
  "fullName": "No Username User"
}

### 6. Duplicate Email or Username in Same Org (Error 409 USER_EMAIL_TAKEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-user-key-003

{
  "email": "jane.doe@resolve.com",
  "username": "jane.doe2",
  "fullName": "Duplicate Email Attempt"
}

### 7. Same Email in Different Org (Success 201 - Tenant Scoped Uniqueness)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{otherOrgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-user-key-004

{
  "email": "jane.doe@resolve.com",
  "username": "jane.doe.other",
  "fullName": "Jane Doe in Org 2"
}

### 8. List Users (Success 200 with Pagination Shape)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}&page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc

### 9. List Users with Filter (Success 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?organizationId={{orgId}}&email=jane.doe@resolve.com

### 10. Get User By ID (Success 200)
@userId = <REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID>
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}

### 11. Get User Belonging to Different Org (Error 404 USER_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}?organizationId={{otherOrgId}}

### 12. Partial Update / Patch User (Success 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe Updated",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 13. Patch User with Invalid Status (Error 400 USER_INVALID_STATUS)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "NON_EXISTENT_STATUS"
}

### 14. Patch User with Colliding Email (Error 409 USER_EMAIL_TAKEN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "another.existing@resolve.com"
}


