POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-team-key-001

{
  "name": "Investigations Team"
}

### 18. Idempotency Reused with Different Body (Error 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-team-key-001

{
  "name": "Different Team Name"
}

