POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-team-key-002

{
  "name": "   "
}

### 20. Duplicate Team Name in Same Org (Error 409 TEAM_NAME_TAKEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-team-key-003

{
  "name": "Investigations Team"
}

### 21. Same Team Name in Different Org (Success 201 - Tenant Scoped)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{otherOrgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-team-key-004

{
  "name": "Investigations Team"
}

### 22. List Teams (Success 200 Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{orgId}}&page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc

### 23. List Teams with Name Filter (Success 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{orgId}}&name=Investigations

### 24. Get Team By ID (Success 200)
# Replace {{teamId}} with the actual id returned from request 15
@teamId = <REPLACE_WITH_TEAM_ID>
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams/{{teamId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}

### 25. Get Team Belonging to Different Org (Error 404 TEAM_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams/{{teamId}}?organizationId={{otherOrgId}}

### 26. Rename Team (Success 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams/{{teamId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Senior Investigations Team"
}

### 27. Rename Team to Existing Name (Error 409 TEAM_NAME_TAKEN)
# Create a second team first, then try to rename it to "Senior Investigations Team"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-team-key-005

{
  "name": "Second Team"
}

### (Try to rename Second Team to Senior Investigations Team)
# Replace {{secondTeamId}} with id from above
@secondTeamId = <REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_TEAM_ID>
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams/{{secondTeamId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Senior Investigations Team"
}

### 28. Delete Team (Success 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams/{{secondTeamId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}

### 29. Verify Deleted Team Returns 404 TEAM_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams/{{secondTeamId}}?organizationId={{orgId}}